### SummonScroll::ScrollSettings::Scroll ###
	One row per summon-scroll item:
	  Index      Scroll id - matched by <Monster> entries below to
	             know which monsters that scroll can summon.
	  ItemIndex  Raw item index (matches Item.xml) of the scroll
	             item.
	  Comment    Free-text label, for readability only.

### SummonScroll::MonsterSettings::Monster ###
	One or more monsters a scroll can summon (several rows sharing
	the same Index = multiple possible monsters for that scroll,
	picked via Group):
	  Index         Which <Scroll> this belongs to.
	  Group         Sub-group within the scroll (0-19,
	                MAX_SUMMON_SCROLL_MONSTER_GROUP) - rows sharing
	                an Index but different Group are all summoned
	                together as one encounter.
	  MonsterClass  Monster class to summon.
	  CreateRate    Spawn weight (out of 10000).
	  Comment       Free-text label, for readability only.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

